	(property "Description" "Mechanical outline (no pads) of the Hansheng HS20HS072RX 2.0in LCD, front view = PCB top view, origin at the panel centre (drawing p.10: 36.2 x 51.8 x 2.05 mm; 12-pin 0.5 mm FPC tail, 6.5 mm wide, leaves the bottom (short) edge 15.28 mm from the left edge, 20.7 mm long). The panel is not assembled by JLC: it is plugged into the FH34SRJ connector by hand. The tail folds 180 deg under the panel (contacts then face the PCB) into the connector, whose origin goes at (0.43, 9.6) with rotation 0 (opening toward the tail edge). F.Fab: panel, folded tail, connector; Cmts.User: foam-tape window; silk: corner marks."
